    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A fresh fusion of Poker and Puzzle! Arrange cards and complete poker hands!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Game Outline\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Poker Solitaire - a new game that adds puzzle elements to creating poker hands.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The player rearranges 25 cards in 5 rows by 5 columns and completes a role within a row to erase a card, earning points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This software has a \u201c2-Minute Mode\u201d in which the player aims for a high score within a time limit, and a \u201cMission Mode\u201d in which the player creates the roles specified one after another and erases them so that the instructions do not overflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game with simple controls, yet offers a variety of ways to develop strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Points\u3011</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>An exhilarating brain game in which players create and eliminate roles!</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The point of this game is to enjoy the brain game in which you have to decide how to efficiently use the cards on the table.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The exhilarating feeling you get when you make a difficult card or eliminate more cards as the limit is approaching is addictive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Your strategic options are limitless!</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In 2-minute mode, various strategies are possible. You can increase your score by taking advantage of combo bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Mission Mode, you can aim for a high score by assessing the situation, such as what instructions are coming next and which instructions to erase first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>You can also participate in ranking!</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By playing in online mode, you can compete with players around the world for scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010How to Play\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(1) After selecting the card you want to move with the Space key, use the WASD key to rearrange the cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(2) Select a row by pressing the E key, and press the Space key to confirm the role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(3) Erase the selected rows to earn points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make hands, clear them, and aim for high scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Two Game Modes\u3011</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>2-Minute Mode</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the highest score in 2 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the same hand consecutively for combo bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the combos continue, bonuses will increase. Create your own strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Mission Mode</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the specified poker hands in sequence. Game over if missions overflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn bonuses by completing all missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intervals between instructions gradually become shorter and the difficulty level increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete as many missions as possible while adapting to the ever-changing situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple yet profound, experience the world of this new brain game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
