</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>You can also participate in ranking!</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By playing in online mode, you can compete with players around the world for scores.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010How to Play\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(1) After selecting the card you want to move with the Space key, use the WASD key to rearrange the cards. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(2) Select a row by pressing the E key, and press the Space key to confirm the role.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(3) Erase the selected rows to earn points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make hands, clear them, and aim for high scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u3010Two Game Modes\u3011</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>2-Minute Mode</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the highest score in 2 minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear the same hand consecutively for combo bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the combos continue, bonuses will increase. Create your own strategy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Mission Mode</u></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the specified poker hands in sequence. Game over if missions overflow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn bonuses by completing all missions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The intervals between instructions gradually become shorter and the difficulty level increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete as many missions as possible while adapting to the ever-changing situation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Simple yet profound, experience the world of this new brain game!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
